#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami merekomendasikan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"This page shows how to use the Qiskit Aer [`noise`](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/apidocs/aer_noise.html) module to build noise models for simulating quantum circuits in the presence of errors. This is useful for emulating noisy quantum processors and for studying the effects of noise on the execution of quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"  - To simulate noisy circuits, see [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives).\n"
"Halaman ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan modul [`noise`](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/apidocs/aer_noise.html) dari Qiskit Aer untuk membangun model noise guna mensimulasikan Circuit kuantum dengan adanya error. Ini berguna untuk mengemulasi prosesor kuantum yang berisik dan untuk mempelajari efek noise pada eksekusi algoritma kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Aer `noise` module {#qiskit-aer-noise-module}"
msgstr "Modul `noise` Qiskit Aer {#qiskit-aer-noise-module}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Aer `noise` module contains Python classes to build customized "
"noise models for simulation. There are three key classes:\n"
msgstr ""
"Modul `noise` Qiskit Aer berisi kelas-kelas Python untuk membangun model "
"noise yang dikustomisasi untuk simulasi. Ada tiga kelas utama:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `NoiseModel` class which stores a noise model used for noisy "
"simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas `NoiseModel` yang menyimpan model noise yang digunakan untuk simulasi "
"berisik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `QuantumError` class which describes CPTP gate errors. These can be "
"applied:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas `QuantumError` yang mendeskripsikan error Gate CPTP. Error ini dapat "
"diterapkan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "After *gate* or *reset* instructions\n"
msgstr "Setelah instruksi *gate* atau *reset*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before *measure* instructions.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum instruksi *measure*.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `ReadoutError` class which describes classical readout errors.\n"
msgstr "Kelas `ReadoutError` yang mendeskripsikan error readout klasik.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize a noise model from a backend {#initialize-a-noise-model-from-a-"
"backend}"
msgstr ""
"Inisialisasi model noise dari Backend {#initialize-a-noise-model-from-a-"
"backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can initialize a noise model with parameters set from the latest "
"calibration data for a physical backend.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menginisialisasi model noise dengan parameter yang diatur dari "
"data kalibrasi terbaru untuk Backend fisik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples,  but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Backend tiruan `FakeSherbrooke` dari `qiskit_ibm_runtime` digunakan dalam contoh-contoh ini, tetapi kamu bisa mencobanya pada Backend nyata atau palsu apa pun yang kompatibel dengan Qiskit.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This will yield a noise model that roughly approximates the errors one would"
" encounter when using that backend. If you want to have more detailed "
"control over the parameters of the noise model, then you'll need to create "
"your own noise model, as described in the rest of this page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini akan menghasilkan model noise yang kira-kira mendekati error yang akan "
"ditemui saat menggunakan Backend tersebut. Jika kamu ingin kontrol lebih "
"detail atas parameter model noise, maka kamu perlu membuat model noise "
"sendiri, seperti yang dijelaskan di sisa halaman ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum errors {#quantum-errors}"
msgstr "Error kuantum {#quantum-errors}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Rather than deal with the `QuantumError` object directly, many helper "
"functions exist to automatically generate a specific type of parameterized "
"quantum error. These are contained in the `noise` module and include "
"functions for many common error types used in quantum computing research. "
"The function names and the type of error they return are:\n"
msgstr ""
"Daripada berurusan langsung dengan objek `QuantumError`, banyak fungsi "
"pembantu yang tersedia untuk menghasilkan secara otomatis tipe error kuantum"
" berparameter tertentu. Fungsi-fungsi ini ada di modul `noise` dan mencakup "
"fungsi untuk banyak tipe error umum yang digunakan dalam penelitian "
"komputasi kuantum. Nama fungsi dan tipe error yang dikembalikannya adalah:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Standard error function | Details |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `kraus_error` | a general n-qubit CPTP error channel given as a list of Kraus matrices $[K_0, ...]$. |\n"
"| `mixed_unitary_error` | an n-qubit mixed unitary error given as a list of unitary matrices and probabilities $[(U_0, p_0),...]$. |\n"
"| `coherent_unitary_error` | an n-qubit coherent unitary error given as a single unitary matrix $U$. |\n"
"| `pauli_error` | an n-qubit Pauli error channel (mixed unitary) given as a list of Pauli's and probabilities $[(P_0, p_0),...]$ |\n"
"| `depolarizing_error` | an n-qubit depolarizing error channel parameterized by a depolarization probability $p$. |\n"
"| `reset_error` | a single-qubit reset error parameterized by probabilities $p_0, p_1$ of resetting to the $\\vert0\\rangle$, $\\vert1\\rangle$ state.|\n"
"| `thermal_relaxation_error` | a single qubit thermal relaxation channel parameterized by relaxation time constants $T_1$, $T_2$, gate time $t$, and excited state thermal population $p_1$. |\n"
"| `phase_amplitude_damping_error` | A single-qubit generalized combined phase and amplitude damping error channel given by an amplitude damping parameter $\\lambda$, a phase damping parameter $\\gamma$, and an excited state thermal population $p_1$. |\n"
"| `amplitude_damping_error` |  A single-qubit generalized amplitude damping error channel given by an amplitude damping parameter $\\lambda$, and an excited state thermal population $p_1$. |\n"
"| `phase_damping_error` |  A single-qubit phase damping error channel given by a phase damping parameter $\\gamma$. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Fungsi error standar | Detail |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `kraus_error` | saluran error CPTP n-Qubit umum yang diberikan sebagai daftar matriks Kraus $[K_0, ...]$. |\n"
"| `mixed_unitary_error` | error uniter campuran n-Qubit yang diberikan sebagai daftar matriks uniter dan probabilitas $[(U_0, p_0),...]$. |\n"
"| `coherent_unitary_error` | error uniter koheren n-Qubit yang diberikan sebagai matriks uniter tunggal $U$. |\n"
"| `pauli_error` | saluran error Pauli n-Qubit (uniter campuran) yang diberikan sebagai daftar Pauli dan probabilitas $[(P_0, p_0),...]$ |\n"
"| `depolarizing_error` | saluran error depolarisasi n-Qubit yang diparameterisasi oleh probabilitas depolarisasi $p$. |\n"
"| `reset_error` | error reset satu-Qubit yang diparameterisasi oleh probabilitas $p_0, p_1$ untuk reset ke keadaan $\\vert0\\rangle$, $\\vert1\\rangle$.|\n"
"| `thermal_relaxation_error` | saluran relaksasi termal satu qubit yang diparameterisasi oleh konstanta waktu relaksasi $T_1$, $T_2$, waktu Gate $t$, dan populasi termal keadaan tereksitasi $p_1$. |\n"
"| `phase_amplitude_damping_error` | Saluran error redaman fase dan amplitudo gabungan umum satu-Qubit yang diberikan oleh parameter redaman amplitudo $\\lambda$, parameter redaman fase $\\gamma$, dan populasi termal keadaan tereksitasi $p_1$. |\n"
"| `amplitude_damping_error` |  Saluran error redaman amplitudo umum satu-Qubit yang diberikan oleh parameter redaman amplitudo $\\lambda$, dan populasi termal keadaan tereksitasi $p_1$. |\n"
"| `phase_damping_error` |  Saluran error redaman fase satu-Qubit yang diberikan oleh parameter redaman fase $\\gamma$. |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Combine quantum errors {#combine-quantum-errors}"
msgstr "Gabungkan error kuantum {#combine-quantum-errors}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumError` instances can be combined by using composition, tensor "
"product, and tensor expansion (reversed order tensor product) to produce new"
" `QuantumErrors` as:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instance `QuantumError` dapat digabungkan menggunakan komposisi, produk "
"tensor, dan perluasan tensor (produk tensor urutan terbalik) untuk "
"menghasilkan `QuantumError` baru sebagai:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Composition: $\\cal{E}(\\rho)=\\cal{E_2}(\\cal{E_1}(\\rho))$ as `error = "
"error1.compose(error2)`\n"
msgstr ""
"Komposisi: $\\cal{E}(\\rho)=\\cal{E_2}(\\cal{E_1}(\\rho))$ sebagai `error = "
"error1.compose(error2)`\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tensor product: $\\cal{E}(\\rho) =(\\cal{E_1}\\otimes\\cal{E_2})(\\rho)$ as "
"`error = error1.tensor(error2)`\n"
msgstr ""
"Produk tensor: $\\cal{E}(\\rho) =(\\cal{E_1}\\otimes\\cal{E_2})(\\rho)$ "
"sebagai `error = error1.tensor(error2)`\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Expand product: $\\cal{E}(\\rho) =(\\cal{E_2}\\otimes\\cal{E_1})(\\rho)$ as "
"`error = error1.expand(error2)`\n"
msgstr ""
"Produk perluasan: $\\cal{E}(\\rho) =(\\cal{E_2}\\otimes\\cal{E_1})(\\rho)$ "
"sebagai `error = error1.expand(error2)`\n"

