#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Readout error {#readout-error}"
msgstr "Error readout {#readout-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Classical readout errors are specified by a list of assignment probability "
"vectors $P(A|B)$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Error readout klasik ditentukan oleh daftar vektor probabilitas penugasan "
"$P(A|B)$:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$A$ is the *recorded* classical bit value\n"
msgstr "$A$ adalah nilai bit klasik yang *dicatat*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$B$ is the *true* bit value returned from the measurement\n"
msgstr "$B$ adalah nilai bit *sebenarnya* yang dikembalikan dari pengukuran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For example, for one qubit: $ P(A|B) = [P(A|0), P(A|1)]$.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh, untuk satu qubit: $ P(A|B) = [P(A|0), P(A|1)]$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Readout errors may also be combined using `compose`, `tensor` and `expand`, "
"like with quantum errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Error readout juga bisa digabungkan menggunakan `compose`, `tensor`, dan "
"`expand`, seperti halnya error kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add errors to a noise model {#add-errors-to-a-noise-model}"
msgstr "Menambahkan error ke noise model {#add-errors-to-a-noise-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When adding a quantum error to a noise model, we must specify the type of "
"*instruction* that it acts on and what qubits to apply it to. There are two "
"cases of quantum errors:\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat menambahkan quantum error ke noise model, kita harus menentukan jenis "
"*instruksi* yang diterapkan dan qubit mana yang dikenai error tersebut. Ada "
"dua jenis quantum error:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' 1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "All-qubit quantum error\n"
msgstr "Quantum error untuk semua qubit\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' 2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specific qubit quantum error\n"
msgstr "Quantum error untuk qubit tertentu\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. All-qubit quantum error {#1-all-qubit-quantum-error}"
msgstr "1. Quantum error untuk semua qubit {#1-all-qubit-quantum-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This applies the same error to any occurrence of an instruction, regardless "
"of which qubits it acts on.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menerapkan error yang sama pada setiap kemunculan suatu instruksi, "
"terlepas dari qubit mana yang dikenainya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is added as `noise_model.add_all_qubit_quantum_error(error, "
"instructions)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara menambahkannya: `noise_model.add_all_qubit_quantum_error(error, "
"instructions)`:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Specific qubit quantum error {#2-specific-qubit-quantum-error}"
msgstr ""
"2. Quantum error untuk qubit tertentu {#2-specific-qubit-quantum-error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This applies the error to any occurrence of an instruction acting on a "
"specified list of qubits. Note that the order of the qubit matters: for "
"example, an error applied to qubits [0, 1] for a two-qubit gate is different"
" to one applied to qubits [1, 0].\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menerapkan error pada setiap kemunculan suatu instruksi yang bertindak "
"pada daftar qubit yang ditentukan. Perlu diperhatikan bahwa urutan qubit "
"penting: misalnya, error yang diterapkan pada qubit [0, 1] untuk gate dua "
"qubit berbeda dengan yang diterapkan pada qubit [1, 0].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is added as `noise_model.add_quantum_error(error, instructions, "
"qubits)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara menambahkannya: `noise_model.add_quantum_error(error, instructions, "
"qubits)`:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note on non-local qubit quantum error {#note-on-non-local-qubit-quantum-"
"error}"
msgstr ""
"Catatan tentang quantum error non-lokal {#note-on-non-local-qubit-quantum-"
"error}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseModel` does not support addition of non-local qubit quantum errors. "
"They should be handled outside of `NoiseModel`. That suggests you should "
"[write your own transpiler pass](/guides/custom-transpiler-pass) "
"(`TransformationPass`) and run the pass just before running the simulator if"
" you need to insert your quantum errors into your circuit under your own "
"conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseModel` tidak mendukung penambahan quantum error non-lokal untuk qubit."
" Error semacam ini harus ditangani di luar `NoiseModel`. Artinya, kamu perlu"
" [membuat transpiler pass sendiri](/guides/custom-transpiler-pass) "
"(`TransformationPass`) dan menjalankan pass tersebut tepat sebelum "
"menjalankan simulator jika ingin menyisipkan quantum error ke dalam Circuit "
"sesuai kondisi yang kamu tentukan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execute a noisy simulation with a noise model {#execute-a-noisy-simulation-"
"with-a-noise-model}"
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan simulasi bersuara dengan noise model {#execute-a-noisy-"
"simulation-with-a-noise-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command `AerSimulator(noise_model=noise_model)` returns a simulator "
"configured to the given noise model. In addition to setting the simulator's "
"noise model, it also overrides the simulator's basis gates, according to the"
" gates of the noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perintah `AerSimulator(noise_model=noise_model)` mengembalikan simulator "
"yang dikonfigurasi sesuai noise model yang diberikan. Selain mengatur noise "
"model simulator, perintah ini juga mengganti basis gates simulator sesuai "
"dengan gates dari noise model.\n"

