#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Example 2: T1/T2 thermal relaxation {#example-2-t1t2-thermal-relaxation}"
msgstr "Contoh 2: Relaksasi termal T1/T2 {#example-2-t1t2-thermal-relaxation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now consider a more realistic error model based on thermal relaxation with the qubit environment:\n"
"* Each qubit is parameterized by a thermal relaxation time constant $T_1$ and a dephasing time constant $T_2$.\n"
"* Note that we must have $T_2 \\le 2 T_1$.\n"
"* Error rates on instructions are determined by gate times and qubit $T_1$, $T_2$ values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari pertimbangkan model error yang lebih realistis berdasarkan relaksasi termal dengan lingkungan qubit:\n"
"* Setiap qubit diparameterisasi oleh konstanta waktu relaksasi termal $T_1$ dan konstanta waktu dephasing $T_2$.\n"
"* Perlu diperhatikan bahwa kita harus memiliki $T_2 \\le 2 T_1$.\n"
"* Tingkat error pada instruksi ditentukan oleh waktu gate dan nilai $T_1$, $T_2$ qubit.\n"

